  "description": "The intended audience is individuals who hold antisemitic beliefs or are exposed to antisemitic content, as the meme is designed to provoke hatred and spread antisemitic stereotypes by targeting Israelis. The visual and textual elements are crafted to resonate with those who accept or are predisposed to antisemitic tropes, such as blood libel variations, dual loyalty accusations, and conspiratorial narratives about Israeli control or violence. The meme’s graphic imagery and hateful generalization are meant to elicit outrage and reinforce existing prejudices against Jews, particularly within communities that propagate antisemitic ideologies.",
